            "question": "What can NxtGen do?",
            "answer": "<ul><li>Advanced Equipment – State-of-the-art HPLC, mass spectrometry, and stability testing systems. </li><li>Comprehensive Testing – From purity and identity confirmation to stability and custom solutions. </li><li>Fast Turnaround – Reports delivered quickly without compromising accuracy. </li><li>Regulatory Compliance – Results formatted to meet research and industry standards</li></ul>",
            "open": true
          }
        },
